root (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial public release of Root resource inspection application.
  * Deterministic read-only platform inspection for agentic workflows.
  * Native GTK4 and Libadwaita desktop graphical interface.
  * Headless Linux CLI with doctor, status, scan, discover, and inspect.
  * Unprivileged user-level systemd scheduling integration.

